    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "D Hart",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114816574917851452209/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHkgyOjXpyqi-hBDKZxAojR3og_JmkKHTdNqzzN8t9Euw4DVj2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent customer service!!!\nI bought my Broil King from Lyne over 10 years ago. They have restored it twice. Instead of telling me it was a lost cause, they have restored it to new once again.  I love my BBQ, I use it rain or shine, also in the winter months, possibly  3 to 4 times a week.\nWhy not buy a new BBQ? Because nothing holds heat like cast, also the size is perfect and I only wanted the rotisserie option without the side burner. So this BBQ is perfect. And it is back to being new again thanks to Charboneau.  Thank you Charboneau!",
        "time": 1599483272,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104498424660183582615/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVfAMhkiOnsCmrkmQYYliG72TJXSSx1gvKNA-dw3Rk7fzDhOU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Hard to believe I’ve never rated this amazing mom and pop store. Reminds me when my father had a photo store.\n\nAmazing service, great prices to fill your propane tanks. I filled 3 today for less than 56$.\n\nOf you need a BBQ, don’t bother with Canadian tire, this place will give you expertise, better product and they actually care.\n\nTwo thumbs up!!!",
        "time": 1723934089,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie Claude Gagnon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105397071956104892710/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEbjszy3jbj7qKWuyds0pp6wmFCTltM47udibPDNZKgiU62A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I have used their services multiple times through the years. Always received top notch service. Shows up on time, does the job right and no need to call him back because there’s a problem. He checks everything before leaving. Super courteous and knowledgeable. You will be told the facts without being talked down to.",
        "time": 1569678955,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kerry Henderson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103627443556617439972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXlBf0lE1bIZkBKNFbxLKJfGB4l2x-wp1liXmf5hyLXvlnEtQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "***update Jan 2024***\n\nThey found a way to gouge the customer. Watch out. Your rental fee will stay low if you order a lot of propane. If you have a mild winter like this year and your consumption is down - they will double your rental fee to make up for it and they do nothing more but just take your money. Unfair.",
        "time": 1704388262,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dmitry Tkachev",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108721132600404858843/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIu81NXwSxjhDEzhv6QWZOGtVxQVE7hznAjcsBZP3puUpXkdA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Filled up propane tank for BBQ for 20$ . It too expensive. Price at rona 17$.\nNever come back here",
